Description    :
mod_uploader is an Apache C++ file uploader with Japanese and English
screens, upload progress, download passwords, deletion, RSS, and optional
thumbnails. This altered version targets FreeBSD and Apache 2.4, with
versioned password hashes, an offline backup-first migration tool, and
session-bound signed CSRF tokens.

See the fork's migration report for tested configurations, rollback steps
and remaining deployment/security limitations.
